# Evendo, Waking Haven's station (CR 702.184a) and what may pay its cost. With no creature Bot1 controls, station is not
# offered: its cost taps another untapped creature (CR 602.2b, 601.2h). Llanowar Elves, cast this turn, stations for one
# counter (not the {T} symbol: CR 107.5, 302.6). A second activation may not tap the Elves again - only an untapped creature
# pays - so it is taken back. In Bot2's turn the untapped Ornithopter could pay, but station is "only as a sorcery"
# (CR 702.184a, 307.1); in Bot1's next main phase it stations, and its 0 power adds nothing. Then Animate Dead returns the
# other Ornithopter (Fatal Pushed on turn 1) as a -1/2: station adds nothing for a negative power and removes nothing either
# (ruling 2025-07-25: "no charge counters are put onto or removed from the permanent"). Evendo keeps its one counter.

